    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Hunters</strong> is an <strong>incremental</strong> game where you fight against <strong>waves of enemies and bosses</strong> through <strong>various stages</strong>, <strong>maps</strong>, and <strong>challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.poster.avif?t=1754239856\" width=616 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.webm?t=1754239856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.mp4?t=1754239856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to <strong>buy upgrades</strong> in the <strong>skill tree</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, or other goods. Each character has <strong>unique features</strong>, weaknesses, and strengths, so pick the one that suits you best to win. Also, upgrades are varied and you can make multiple <strong>custom builds</strong> or <strong>synergies</strong>. These <strong>upgrades give</strong> <strong>new or empower old passives</strong>, award <strong>new abilities</strong>, unlock <strong>more skill trees</strong>, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A map is made up of multiple levels and there's also <strong>post-end content</strong>, so get ready to fight a lot of bugs and protect your system against these threats.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Hunters</strong> is an <strong>incremental</strong> game where you fight against <strong>waves of enemies and bosses</strong> through <strong>various stages</strong>, <strong>maps</strong>, and <strong>challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.poster.avif?t=1754239856\" width=616 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.webm?t=1754239856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.mp4?t=1754239856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to <strong>buy upgrades</strong> in the <strong>skill tree</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, or other goods. Each character has <strong>unique features</strong>, weaknesses, and strengths, so pick the one that suits you best to win. Also, upgrades are varied and you can make multiple <strong>custom builds</strong> or <strong>synergies</strong>. These <strong>upgrades give</strong> <strong>new or empower old passives</strong>, award <strong>new abilities</strong>, unlock <strong>more skill trees</strong>, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A map is made up of multiple levels and there's also <strong>post-end content</strong>, so get ready to fight a lot of bugs and protect your system against these threats.</p>",
